  "content": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Consider the grammar:"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nS \\to A S A ~ | ~ a B\\tag{25}\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nA \\to B \\mid S\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nB  b \\mid \\epsilon\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "i) Eliminate ε productions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "ii) Eliminate unit productions in the resulting grammar from (i)."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "iii)Eliminate useless productions in the resulting grammar from (ii)."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "iv) Put the grammar from (iii) in Chomsky Normal Form (CNF)."
    }
  ],
